              <p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">When 
                the media says that there has been calm in the Middle East these 
                last few days, please make sure that you understand what that 
                means: that there has not been any Israelis killed. Violence against 
                Palestinians -- against children -- literally does not count! 
                </font></p>
              <p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">Indeed, 
                three Palestinian teenagers were killed last night, January 2, 
                2002, and NO MENTION OF IT WHATSOEVER in the news today -- NONE! 
                </font></p>
              <p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">Below 
                is a story detailing the killing of the three boys. Anyone who 
                has read New York Times journalist <a href="/sites/pmwatch.org/pmw/features/gazadiary.html">Chris 
                Hedges' Gaza Diary</a> knows what is taking place: keeping the 
                Palestinians at the boiling point, provoking them, and making 
                sure that nothing resembling a move toward lasting peace takes 
                place. </font></p>
              <p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2"> 
                Please add your comments if you wish and just click on the 'Send' 
                button, and the message below will be sent to all the major media 
                outlets, print as well as electronic. </font></p>
              <p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">If 
                the media won't listen to our patient reasoning, maybe they will 
                listen when hundreds of people raise their voice in protest over 
                their shameless irresponsibility.</font></p>
              <p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">Please 
                make sure that your email address and name are correct. </font></p>
              <p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">Palestine 
                Media Watch - <a href="/sites/pmwatch.org/index.html" class="dead" aria-disabled="true">http://www.pmwatch.org</a></font></p>
